        "description": "Returns the matches for OpenLigaDB's current group or matchday in one league. This mirrors the source's current-matchday route; a league without a current matchday may return not found. Use `openligadb_current_group` to see the selected group id or `openligadb_matches` for a whole season.",
        "operationId": "openligadb-current-matchday",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "description": "Exact shortcut from openligadb-leagues",
            "in": "query",
            "name": "league_shortcut",
